      "id": "claim_9c9c9b008eb04b9683ad7899965d2e0b",
      "statement": "The Router interface has add and match, where match returns either an indexed result (handlers with param index maps plus a param stash) or a direct result (handlers with param values), and routers return all matching handlers in registration order.",
      "evidence": [
